# A new class declared inside the IES4 namespace instead of a local one.
# ies:Hovercraft is not part of IES4, so it has no IES-Next equivalent. A check should reject it.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ies: <http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#> .

ies:Hovercraft a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ies:Vehicle .
